      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Tang clan’s immortal formation, after exploring two stages of Thieving Heaven’s dream realm, Fang Yuan recalls that in his first life Tang Fang Ming created the dream path immortal killer move Steal Dream. He had once blamed that creation on Shadow Sect’s help; after seeing Tang Fang Ming’s dream path mortal Gu work against that hard dream realm, he judges Steal Dream more likely Tang Fang Ming’s own work.",
      "chapters": [
        1502
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "first-life-origin",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tang_fang_ming",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "sys_dream_path_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the third stage of that dream realm, Fang Yuan again thinks of Tang Fang Ming and of the steal dream killer move Tang Fang Ming created in Fang Yuan’s first life, then notes that later ages produced many dream path Gu worms and killer moves aimed at different dream realms.",
